35
00:51:05.730 --> 00:51:08.730
I don't know. I think I am still paying it off every month.

36
00:51:10.730 --> 00:51:15.730
But the point is, and what I want to say is that it does not come from us.

37
00:51:16.730 --> 00:51:18.730
It is from him.

38
00:51:19.730 --> 00:51:22.730
And that should be our attitude when we give.

39
00:51:23.730 --> 00:51:30.730
And what was also so special, and I encourage that every time again, is to think about what you give.

40
00:51:31.730 --> 00:51:35.730
Because that actually came to my mind that we have everything from him.

41
00:51:36.730 --> 00:51:38.730
And we are going to give something back.

42
00:51:40.730 --> 00:51:43.730
And we could say, okay, we give it.

43
00:51:44.730 --> 00:51:52.730
