01:00:15.730 --> 01:00:23.730
In the Bible, I see a pattern regarding God's provision.

159
01:00:24.730 --> 01:00:33.730
But God's provision, I see in that pattern forming itself every time in the person of God Himself.

160
01:00:36.730 --> 01:00:41.730
For what more can you ask for than God Himself?

161
01:00:44.730 --> 01:00:46.730
I have a question for us at the beginning.

162
01:00:47.730 --> 01:00:51.730
What are you praying for these days?

163
01:00:52.730 --> 01:00:56.730
Think about it, what are your prayers these days?

164
01:00:58.730 --> 01:00:59.730
At all?

165
01:01:01.730 --> 01:01:02.730
Are you praying?

166
01:01:04.730 --> 01:01:06.730
That is an important question. Think about it for a moment.

167
01:01:06.730 --> 01:01:12.730
What are actually the main prayers that you pray?

168
01:01:13.730 --> 01:01:16.730
What are you actually praying for?

169
01:01:17.730 --> 01:01:21.730
What are the topics you pray about?

170
01:01:23.730 --> 01:01:28.730
