224
01:06:57.730 --> 01:06:59.730
He is the provider.

225
01:06:59.730 --> 01:07:01.730
He is the creator.

226
01:07:01.730 --> 01:07:04.730
He is the one from whom everything comes.

227
01:07:04.730 --> 01:07:10.730
