233
01:07:33.730 --> 01:07:37.730
Abraham, in obedience, gives his son to God.

234
01:07:37.730 --> 01:07:40.730
But God says, stop it.

235
01:07:40.730 --> 01:07:42.730
I provide.

236
01:07:42.730 --> 01:07:45.730
God provides in creation himself.

237
01:07:45.730 --> 01:07:48.730
God provides in Abraham, what does he provide?

238
01:07:48.730 --> 01:07:49.730
The lamb.

239
01:07:49.730 --> 01:07:50.730
Who is the lamb?

240
01:07:50.730 --> 01:07:51.730
Let us speak his name.

241
01:07:51.730 --> 01:07:53.730
The lamb is Jesus.

242
01:07:53.730 --> 01:08:02.730
God provides the lamb, Jesus Christ, in the Old Testament, in the old, old, old times of the Bible.

243
01:08:02.730 --> 01:08:05.730
Abraham is a long time ago, believe me.

